    {
      "id": "3342bed1-584f-4247-a9ed-bfaee351f4d9",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e relacione a expressão ao momento antes da refeição.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "4a0a465f-4ae6-4148-966f-3c98292eebda",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Poner la mesa</strong> aparece antes de comer, quando alguém organiza pratos, copos e talheres.</p><p>Em casa compartilhada, essa tarefa costuma entrar em combinados rápidos porque acontece com frequência e é fácil perceber quando ninguém fez.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "95077189-067e-468e-906a-b37348458d01",
      "title": "Observe a imagem, escute a expressão e conecte o espanhol ao contexto da casa.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "6b6dd2f3-5488-46b2-bec5-1e9bd28520af",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>tender la ropa</strong></p><p>Em português: estender a roupa para secar.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/21f0d549e065407fb7221a9c286e5525_b03-tender-la-ropa.png?Expires=1794099609&Signature=ir4utDpiD1qMUd0BF9bN-8uR3nZrvfltQ~pMk7cuIglQOoT2zJ3yx4XKEgiPavU2qE-tP5CMvr1vynCWqqZfP5V8lWiC2jVXc-AmdFf-rjVsNxr3g~Oih69mKMnbjy2tkZ8xly5D4~RTisIStoqDb2ph7WFdw4Yh04wU3ntyOmQd9Zq42mwYmMdoMfKhgWr0VTvYp7JbGZwE~zDvaTPnEY86b-QLKHgKKeNWto9C9FmlLjmpmoAsV9iG4h0a4XaFT16aqucvmBn3X7plj~9ezouxCbj2mOlkfiPcKlFy8dpWIYx3JNmudiI5rrY1IbXTMMC8KVyjjXzFQAswgrtPNg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/5a30fc74ad8245f49be82941f29e7886_b03-tender-la-ropa.mp3?Expires=1794099609&Signature=BzeTcnBFtsATZi8LX1w8GZb3k6nMFD4CDoIO6YjnL9wFkw20UcRLtf8hc3BAAV6onRME1QrOd7AM04Sxba1HBlmxAgO2VSXScwroiP-ASW~V7qw3kPJhl6CleIczedqPCFSYeN1qpFgEuDCK6nWdqfEk7lSG0gy0c9gNzsM3fBJbKNfGqwpmDSHj43Vt6VkxCbixqdiaNCVpiQ2ezYk7Vrl1Btmhhj~C0jokgs4zlQV8WM5WougQLaJyrPgKmFF2Wqp88P7FNSMr5E-xlLCPuLqlMMT8Z1PEPqnZz9mIWB7n~R0EoUQ-65HL3Mjw-WFHMnmaznmAFcZjBh6s19I6OA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
